OL,3,GNEWSAMan found dead after house fire
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has died in a house fire in
OL,6,FNuneaton, West Midlands Ambulance
OL,7,FService has confirmed.
OL,9,FEmergency services attended the
OL,10,Fincident on Amos Avenue at 11:41am BST
OL,11,Fon Monday.
OL,13,FWarwickshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,14,F(WFRS) said it was alerted to a fire at
OL,15,Fa two-storey semi-detached property
OL,16,Fand, on arrival, crews discovered a
OL,17,Fblaze on the ground floor.
OL,19,F"One man was found and sadly it became
OL,20,Fclear he could not be saved and he was
OL,21,Fconfirmed dead at the scene," the
OL,22,Fambulance service said.
